[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223870384","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223870384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223870384,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzg3MDM4NA==","user":{"login":"carljm","id":61586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm","html_url":"https://github.com/carljm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carljm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T05:16:13Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T05:16:13Z","body":"This LGTM. The main thing I'm concerned about is the potential for someone to still introduce a timezone-setting query inadvertently into a test in a SimpleTestCase, and have to go through the same debugging process @aisipos did again. The failure mode there is not very obvious, it just contaminates the db connection timezone state for the remainder of the test suite. \n\nIt might be worth considering whether we can actually prohibit all database queries within a `SimpleTestCase`, for faster and more obvious failure. But I guess that's really orthogonal to this PR; this PR at least improves the situation. \n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223870384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223874779","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223874779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223874779,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzg3NDc3OQ==","user":{"login":"charettes","id":9293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes","html_url":"https://github.com/charettes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T06:00:01Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T06:00:53Z","body":"> It might be worth considering whether we can actually prohibit all database queries within a SimpleTestCase, for faster and more obvious failure.\n\nThat's what we do since c15b0c27927afd141d311dd9bfe68540cf44a8d6. I think the origin of the failure wasn't obvious because of the stack trace leading to the `setting_changed` receiver attempt to create a cursor. The call to `ensure_timezone()` should make things a bit clearer I suppose.\n\nThere are two remaining cases that can trigger a `SET TIMEZONE` on PostgreSQL:\n1. Enabling/disabling `USE_TZ` while setting `TIME_ZONE` to a different value;\n2. Changing a connection's `setting_dict['TIME_ZONE']` to a different value.\n\nIt believe that only `1.` can cause trouble here as you should be using `TestCase` or `TransactionTestCase` if you're fizzling with a database's connection.\n\nThe only solution I can think to solve `1.` would be to defer the `SET TIMEZONE` execution to the first attempt to `execute()` through a cursor of the affected connection. I'm afraid this could lead to hard to debug scenarios and could break test utilities such as `assertNumQueries()`.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223874779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223875241","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223875241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223875241,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzg3NTI0MQ==","user":{"login":"charettes","id":9293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes","html_url":"https://github.com/charettes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T06:04:24Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T06:04:24Z","body":"@aaugustin, any thoughts about this change?\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223875241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223907872","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223907872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223907872,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzkwNzg3Mg==","user":{"login":"aaugustin","id":788910,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODkxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/788910?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/aaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T09:18:13Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T09:18:13Z","body":"I think this change is fine. It needs a warning in the release notes because changes to the connection's time zone during tests will leak, while they used to be reset.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223907872/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223960883","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223960883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223960883,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzk2MDg4Mw==","user":{"login":"charettes","id":9293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes","html_url":"https://github.com/charettes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T13:37:29Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T13:45:33Z","body":"> I think this change is fine. It needs a warning in the release notes because changes to the connection's time zone during tests will leak, while they used to be reset.\n\nCan you come up with a testcase that would cause a time zone leak with the new approach exclusively?\n\nChanging the connection's time zone without overriding the `TIME_ZONE` setting was always a source of possible leaks.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223960883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223963896","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223963896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223963896,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzk2Mzg5Ng==","user":{"login":"aaugustin","id":788910,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODkxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/788910?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/aaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T13:48:07Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T13:48:07Z","body":"I assume `cursor.execute(\"SET TIME ZONE Europe/Paris\")` in a `TransactionTestCase` should leak?\n\nIndeed there's only a backwards-incompatibility if the user relied on overriding `TIME_ZONE` to reset the time zone in such a test.\n\nGiven the conditions needed to trigger the problem, this starts looking like a really edgy edge case... I don't have a strong opinion on whether to explain it in the release notes.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223963896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223977623","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223977623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223977623,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzk3NzYyMw==","user":{"login":"charettes","id":9293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes","html_url":"https://github.com/charettes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charettes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T14:35:14Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T14:35:14Z","body":"> I assume cursor.execute(\"SET TIME ZONE Europe/Paris\") in a TransactionTestCase should leak?\n\nAs connections are [reloaded](https://github.com/django/django/blob/master/django/test/testcases.py#L918-L926) between each `TransactionTestCase` tests tear down `init_connection_state` will be called and reset the correct time zone for each of them before the next test runs.\n\n> Given the conditions needed to trigger the problem, this starts looking like a really edgy edge case... I don't have a strong opinion on whether to explain it in the release notes.\n\nAs we can't come up with conditions to trigger a leak I don't think it's necessary.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223977623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223981539","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223981539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223981539,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzk4MTUzOQ==","user":{"login":"timgraham","id":411869,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTg2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/411869?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham","html_url":"https://github.com/timgraham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timgraham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T14:48:04Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T14:48:04Z","body":"necessarly -> necessarily in first commit message and \"workarounds\" (one word) in second, otherwise LGTM.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223981539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223989279","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/6731#issuecomment-223989279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/6731","id":223989279,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMzk4OTI3OQ==","user":{"login":"aaugustin","id":788910,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODkxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/788910?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/aaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-06-06T15:12:44Z","updated_at":"2016-06-06T15:12:44Z","body":"Right. I give up ;-)\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/comments/223989279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]